스튜디오 품질의 오디오</h3><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">모든 Spotify 노래는 사용 가능한 최고 비트 전송률인 최대 320kbps <a href="/ko/spotify-to-mp3/">MP3</a> 품질로 저장됩니다. 완전히 오프라인으로 듣는 경우에도 Spotify에서 들리는 것과 똑같은 선명하고 깨끗한 오디오를 즐겨보세요.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-md border transition-all bg-white border-black/5 shadow-xl shadow-black/[0.02] hover:border-[#0f7a35]/20 dark:bg-transparent dark:border-white/5 dark:shadow-none dark:hover:border-[#1db954]/20"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-md text-[#0f7a35] dark:text-[#1db954] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 bg-[#0f7a35]/10 dark:bg-[#1db954]/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold mb-3 text-lg">무제한 무료 노래 다운로드</h3><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">개별 Spotify 노래를 원하는 만큼 무료로 다운로드하세요. 일일 제한, 페이월, 구독 계획이 없으며 제한이 없는 무제한 트랙 다운로드만 가능합니다.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-md border transition-all bg-white border-black/5 shadow-xl shadow-black/[0.02] hover:border-[#0f7a35]/20 dark:bg-transparent dark:border-white/5 dark:shadow-none dark:hover:border-[#1db954]/20"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-md text-[#0f7a35] dark:text-[#1db954] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 bg-[#0f7a35]/10 dark:bg-[#1db954]/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 12c-2-2.67-4-4-6-4a4 4 0 1 0 0 8c2 0 4-1.33 6-4Zm0 0c2 2.67 4 4 6 4a4 4 0 0 0 0-8c-2 0-4 1.33-6 4Z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold mb-3 text-lg">로그인 또는 등록 없음</h3><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">계정을 만들지 않고도 즉시 <a href="/ko/spotify-track-downloader/">Spotify 노래</a> 다운로드를 시작하세요. 이메일 주소, 비밀번호, 가입 양식이 필요하지 않습니다. 브라우저에서 SpotSaver를 열고 좋아하는 트랙을 바로 다운로드하세요.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-md border transition-all bg-white border-black/5 shadow-xl shadow-black/[0.02] hover:border-[#0f7a35]/20 dark:bg-transparent dark:border-white/5 dark:shadow-none dark:hover:border-[#1db954]/20"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-md text-[#0f7a35] dark:text-[#1db954] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 bg-[#0f7a35]/10 dark:bg-[#1db954]/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" x2="8" y1="13" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" x2="8" y1="17" y2="17"></line><line x1="10" x2="8" y1="9" y2="9"></line></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold mb-3 text-lg">모든 장치에서 작동</h3><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400"><a href="/ko/">SpotSaver</a>는 브라우저에서 완전히 실행되므로 앱 설치가 필요하지 않습니다. iPhone, Android, Windows, Mac 또는 Linux에서 Spotify 노래를 다운로드하면 모든 기기와 브라우저가 완벽하게 지원됩니다.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-md border transition-all bg-white border-black/5 shadow-xl shadow-black/[0.02] hover:border-[#0f7a35]/20 dark:bg-transparent dark:border-white/5 dark:shadow-none dark:hover:border-[#1db954]/20"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-md text-[#0f7a35] dark:text-[#1db954] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 bg-[#0f7a35]/10 dark:bg-[#1db954]/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold mb-3 text-lg">Spotify 링크 없이 검색</h3><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">Spotify URL이 없나요? 검색창에 노래 이름, 아티스트 이름 또는 가사의 일부를 입력하세요. SpotSaver는 정확한 트랙을 찾아 즉시 다운로드할 수 있도록 해줍니다. 링크가 필요하지 않습니다.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-20 max-w-[980px] mx-auto px-3 w-full"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h2 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4 tracking-tight">Spotify 노래 다운로더 – 자주 묻는 질문</h2><div class="h-1.5 w-16 bg-[#0f853c] dark:bg-[#1db954] mx-auto rounded-md"></div></div><div class="p-2 md:p-6 rounded-md border bg-white border-black/5 shadow-xl shadow-black/[0.02] dark:bg-[#121212] dark:border-white/10 dark:shadow-none"><div class="border-b last:border-0 border-black/5 dark:border-white/5"><button class="w-full py-6 flex justify-between items-center text-left group cursor-pointer px-4" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="font-bold text-lg transition-colors flex-1 pr-4 group-hover:text-[#0f7a35] dark:group-hover:text-[#1db954] text-black dark:text-white">이 Spotify 노래 다운로더는 무료로 사용할 수 있나요?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:text-[#0f7a35] dark:group-hover:text-[#1db954] text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div><div class="border-b last:border-0 border-black/5 dark:border-white/5"><button class="w-full py-6 flex justify-between items-center text-left group cursor-pointer px-4" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="font-bold text-lg transition-colors flex-1 pr-4 group-hover:text-[#0f7a35] dark:group-hover:text-[#1db954] text-black dark:text-white">Spotify 노래를 다운로드하려면 계정을 만들어야 합니까?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:text-[#0f7a35] dark:group-hover:text-[#1db954] text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></butt